WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:10.541
Good evening!

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.916
As reigning realm champions and, with that,

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:15.458
Eastern Conference champions,

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:17.875
we welcome the representatives from each 

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.750
of the Eastern playoff Houses,

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.958
to the annual Feast of the East,

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:26.208
to kick off this year’s playoffs. So please, feast!

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:27.750
Oh my god, look at this,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.416
there’s like so many wings!

00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:30.958
I hope Terrence is happy

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:33.291
I know Dwane Casey was pretty pissed that we took the horse

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:36.208
He scares me. Look at those hands. They're huge!

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:38.250
My mentality is you just gotta take it one game at a time

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.208
I mean, I just try to leave 110% on the court

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:42.333
Pass me the pigeon pie!

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:44.250
Hey! ...Hey!

00:00:44.583 --> 00:00:45.708
What are you staring at?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.000
Is there a pot of gold behind me?

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.166
Is there a shamrock in my teeth?

00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:54.916
No, I’m just looking at the second-best team in the East

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:56.375
Oh snap

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Big balls for such a small man

00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:02.791
...DWARF

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:04.708
Oooh

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:07.625
Yeah, yeah, I’ve heard it all before

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:10.041
He’s too short. He can’t play defense

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.500
Hell, he isn’t even the best Isiah Thomas

00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:16.791
But somehow, this dwarf’s been scoring 30 points a game,

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.000
hitting clutch shots,

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.750
and House Celtics owns the No. 1 seed

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:23.166
When this tournament’s over,

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.875
you’re all gonna look UP at me,

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:26.875
and you’ll know…

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:29.500
there’s a new King in the East!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.125
This again? Didn’t we do this last year?

00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:39.458
We’ve got the chemistry and the defense to take you down

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:42.333
Don’t sleep on the two seed my dear King,

00:01:42.666 --> 00:01:44.708
for the North will soon rule the East

00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:48.208
We are the New Kings of the East!

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.333
This again? Didn’t we do this last year?

00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:54.166
60 wins. Count ‘em

00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:58.916
It puts us in the one seed, and our house goes 12 men deep

00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:01.666
We are the Spurs of the East

00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:02.875
Tell ‘em Korverbird

00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:05.291
*HAWK SCREECH* TEAM BASKETBALL!

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.250
This year, there will be a NEW KING OF THE EAST!

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:11.333
We’re doing this again?

00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:13.541
You’re on your last leg, LeBron

00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:16.458
We’re coming for you

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:20.416
There will be a new king in the East

00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:22.583
And this time I MEAN IT

00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:26.625
OK, Paul, you literally did this last year

00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:29.583
The era of Paul George,

00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:34.125
of Roy Hibbert and House Pacers begins now! 

00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:35.125
Verticality!

00:02:35.375 --> 00:02:39.166
There will be a new KING IN THE EAST!

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:41.166
We’re doing this a--

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:44.708
They say your superteam can’t be beat,

00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:49.375
but we got the original Big Three and I say…

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:52.458
ANYTHING IS POSSIBLE

00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:54.875
KG was wrong

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.375
It's not true

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.250
Nothing is possible

00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:00.166
Th-there's no point in trying

00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:02.583
Le-LeBron wins the East every year

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:04.541
We should all be tanking

00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:06.166
The playoffs are a trap!

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:07.958
They're gonna beat us all!

00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:08.916
It's a trap!

00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:10.416
We've gotta get out of here!

00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:11.208
GET OUT!

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:12.041
GO TANK!

00:03:12.041 --> 00:03:13.458
GO TANK FOR THE FUTURE!

